Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls, and I\Nsee the sky, I think the rain is falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything\Nwill take what I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.28,0:01:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what, I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest storms of\Nall can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.74,0:01:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.90,0:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing that can stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The times that are on our side\Nwill never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a tunnel of flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were little, you've\Nnever listened to a word I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you run off and do something crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like old times. Huh, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Firefist Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's free!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.35,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You did a Straw Hat! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can suck it, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't slowed down once\Nafter all he's been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Your papa would be so proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That crazy little bastard saved Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, he's Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire as soon as they land! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split up for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down yet! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame Commandment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're strong! Be careful, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you still fight, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Ace is a Logia Titan, so\Nhe's going to be really tough to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd need my\Nlittle brother to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll swallow my pride this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you one, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I sure couldn't have done\Nit if Whitebeard hadn't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we'll let you get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this your\Nexecution ground, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my little brother\Nyou're trying to murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask you to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:06:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun and all, but the sooner\Nwe leave this dump, the better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.06,0:06:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a fine team. I dare say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pulling out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear a path!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Firefly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't over yet. Execute them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to admit, you've\Ngotten pretty tough, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these days, I'll\Nbe stronger than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then I'll handle\Nthings in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.12,0:07:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, ice block.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Pheasant Beak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame Mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the worst blunder of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to rectify this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes things more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I say
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys went toe-to-toe\Nwith an admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are we supposed\Nto do pull yourselves together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't make it out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,two i hope i could honor\Nyour memory in my own humble
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,way anywho that's enough\Nheroism For a lifetime I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving what, Splatoon is\Nthis traitor from no hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,he's a prisoner Impersonating\Na guard no I was too slow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.10,0:08:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy ship is coming\Nthrough. On land somehow. Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,get close It's running on\Nthe ground with his paddles
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who's on board? I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Squared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like he's\Ngot his crew with him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a break for it, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll guard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll show those bastards the\Npride of the spider world pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot. squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.08,0:09:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got a death wish or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,After what I did to Pops,\Nthis is the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hope to atone for my crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't die fighting here,\NI know I'll never rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for bringing you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.42,0:10:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be my fight. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanted to follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're our captain,\Nto the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If we all die here,\Nthen that's our choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not get sentimental here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the charge, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else grab Ace\Nand make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.28,0:10:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Saint Helmer's Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Squared, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you think anyone's going to\Nbe happy with a plan like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.94,0:10:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up and get\Nthese cuffs off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:10:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we run into something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But why, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe you've done me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor, selfish child!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how cruel it is to\Nforce a father to bury his own sons?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And show some humility!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm on my last legs\Nbecause of one measly poke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It was settled long before I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has to grow old and die someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,business is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull out now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll stay here to make sure I don't\Nlose any more of my boys to these bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, White Beard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen well!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,These are my final orders as your captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you better follow them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last thing we want to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.92,0:12:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going back together! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go on without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't save Ace to let our captain die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.46,0:12:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Crossfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even family must part ways now and then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the New World!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue your legacy without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.39,0:12:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We can find another way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.56,0:13:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a relic of a bygone era!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Long have I sailed, but no ship\Ncan carry me into the new age.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go and forge your own path!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.00,0:13:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.40,0:13:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know how you\Nfeel, but it's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hulk, I know. What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A new age is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, what a hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't even care\Nabout treasure, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty to go around, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.20,0:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, he's always like this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't even have these\Ntreasures without him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you looking for then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You listening, Newgate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long journey, but a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finally put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The rainforest's falling apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody stop Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's gonna\Nbring down the whole island!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here as a family!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave as one, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:14:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops, come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean to disobey your captain's order?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you fools to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be our only chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit Wipe here with all you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, we're better\Noff doing what Pops says.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops is our father!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't leave him here to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.34,0:15:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think any of us want\NDial Pops behind? Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bickering about your own petty\Nfeelings at a time like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the kind of stuff\NPops wouldn't stand for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that he's trying\Nto do what's best for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.46,0:15:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get back on the ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to take off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Marco, let's head back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He no longer has to worry\Nabout saving firefish days.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as his men can escape, he'll\Nsink Marineford and all of us with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's prepared to die. I've no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard thinks our era is over?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the old man is probably right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know what\Nhappened to Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What about his allies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he really sell them out or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to write\Na story on the battle now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with their snails?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't go out all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That piece of crap is\Nstill hiding in its shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back out here, Mr. Snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy's ready\Nto defeat Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they realize what they're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Whitebeard's wounded, but\Nhe's tearing down buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd I have to go and say I'd beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,These morons believe\Nanything you tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's their fault for feeding my ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help it! Lure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta showcase Captain Buggy's\Nawesomeness for the entire world to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just smash the shell open.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, one strong pound ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit messing with the\Npaw thing, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The transponder snail came out on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,we're starting the broadcast and make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you capture the moment\Nthat I kill Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.58,0:17:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Transponder snail, go down a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, hello everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the sea! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get on the ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.96,0:18:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta make it back to\Nthe new world and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill as many pirates as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only pirate you\Nshould be worrying about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in pretty bad shape,\Nbut I think he can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we got to get him\Nout of here to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ape 1-Eye! Get over here! On the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, straw boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to make an exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,On the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The old guy made up his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.74,0:19:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.62,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for words has passed, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.34,0:20:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy to have this\Nold fool as your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You got some fight left?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not gonna kill\Nyou today, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too valuable to\Ndie in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Run wild with us and our\Nflight will be yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will call you my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.38,0:21:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They're specifically targeting you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot let the old man waste his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He will not fall in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We've stolen the Navy ship. Hop aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they really think they stand\Na chance of escaping? How naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Sakazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.76,0:21:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Move aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that just don't stop\Nrunning until you reach the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.90,0:22:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as they rescued Fire Fist\NAce they fled what a cowardly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,crew just like their washed up\NCaptain he's trying to get you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,riled up don't listen keep it\Nmoving don't fall into his trap
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me, yeah, that old man, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,some captain he is it's not your
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.24,0:22:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,fault that's Just Whitebeard\Na washed-up failure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,failure
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.04,0:22:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,take
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It back or else Ace no don't. Just\Nkeep moving. He can say whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,he wants let's go no one gets
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.48,0:22:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,away with mocking Pops Stop take
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.26,0:22:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it back it's not an insult it's\Nthe truth let me tell you a story
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:23:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father conquered the Grand Line something\Nno other pirate has ever accomplished
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.34,0:23:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,After that he opened the door to the great\Npirate era by sacrificing his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it being a Navy Admiral, but\Nhe was King of the Pirates, no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.44,0:23:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keeping all that in mind,\NWhitebeard has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.40,0:23:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,His lack of ambition\Nmeant he'd never be king
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,of anything but you simple-minded cronies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.22,0:23:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he brainwashed enough of you into\Ndoing his dirty work, he got lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.46,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Every now and then you'll find someone\Nwho paints him as a peacekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Start trouble here and Whitebeard\Nwill come running, they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.06,0:23:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty post to keep\Nidiots like you fearful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.22,0:23:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You call him hero when\Nhe's nothing but a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.98,0:23:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When Gold Roger was around,\NWhitebeard always had second billing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet even after Roger's death,\Nhe couldn't become king.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So there it is, the tale of\Nyour father's whipping boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.46,0:24:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the great failure Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.32,0:24:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, he'll be dead,\Nand no one will remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.94,0:24:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but feel sorry for the man,\Nand all you punks call him your pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.30,0:24:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you make this fake family to humor\Nhim, or are you just as deluded? Shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He sailed the seas for years,\Ncouldn't amount to anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.78,0:24:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,amassed an army of losers,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the end was even\Nstabbed by one of his own
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,sons who put more stock\Nin my word than his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.64,0:24:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And still, he'll die to protect that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of\Na more pathetic life?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Leave\Nhim. Run. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing fake about\Nthe family he gave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.26,0:24:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't expect a heartless\Nbastard like you to appreciate that
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.74,0:24:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,like I said he convinced You punk\Nyou meant something to the world but
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,your kind doesn't deserve a home you\Ndeserve The gallows you know it's
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.24,0:25:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,True, you'll all die as failures, and\NWhitebeard's nothing but a lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.68,0:25:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard is the greatest pirate\Nwho ever lived, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.04,0:25:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything about\Nthe man who saved my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.04,0:25:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from the base!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is his era!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.74,0:25:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pops will end up\Nthe same as you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.98,0:25:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead and by my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.35,0:25:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he burn him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.60,0:25:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your Logia-type fruit,\Nyou're not used to being hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.34,0:25:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made you too cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.64,0:25:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be made of fire, but my\Nmagma burns even hotter than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.96,0:26:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Whitebeard,\Nsecond-rate to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.22,0:26:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.50,0:26:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stay out of harm's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.52,0:26:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no condition to battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.40,0:26:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's his fever cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.50,0:26:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.82,0:26:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And Dragon the Revolutionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.62,0:26:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that the two of\Nyou were adopted brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.36,0:26:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.84,0:26:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a victory it'd be\Nto end both bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.94,0:26:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you are the\Nonly targets I'm after.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.74,0:26:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye? Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.02,0:26:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.78,0:26:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
